#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Master script content for 'How to Stop Procrastination' — 6-part series + teaser.
Every scene: id, narration (spoken verbatim), queries (imgagent CC image searches),
labels (on-screen text w/ at-fraction), graphic (optional), hl (subtitle bold phrases),
quote (optional). Subtitles are generated VERBATIM from narration (sync root-cause fix).
Gate-tuned: digits for numbers (Edge speaks them), cause/effect connectives, comparisons
for big figures, 3+ retention hooks, opening hooks, <=28-word sentences, task/brain/loop
repetition caps. Numbers on screen must exist in nghien_cuu.md (ledger)."""

